sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Task driver in CPU container
  participant C as Docker CLI / provider
  participant E as Dedicated Docker daemon
  participant S as Per-task sandbox
  D->>C: start sandbox
  C->>E: create + start over Unix socket
  E->>S: launch task container
  loop agent tools and verification
    D->>C: exec / files
    C->>E: exec or archive API
    E->>S: run command / transfer files
    S-->>D: exit code + stdout + stderr / files
  end
  D->>C: stop sandbox
  C->>E: DELETE container, force=true
  E->>S: terminate and remove
  Note over D,E: Independent janitor also reclaims expired owned containers

